      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Um, honestly, it's a hot red swollen big toe, and my family pushed me to come. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible.",
