    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It's ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning for my blood pressure. Ibuprofen. I take it 400 milligrams, three times a day. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it.",
