        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Okay, thinking it through, I'd lean towards an acute gout attack. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together.",
