      "evidence_id": "EV_028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an acute gout attack do well once it's treated properly. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had a hot red swollen big toe for about two weeks, severe, and no rash or injury.",
